WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.970
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.240 --> 01:41.240
[Episode 9]

3
01:49.720 --> 01:52.080
[Orderly Room] [Supervision Office]

4
01:55.018 --> 01:57.018
[Supply Office] [Advisor's Office]

5
02:10.966 --> 02:12.366
[Archives]

6
02:23.320 --> 02:24.533
Secretary Jiang.

7
02:25.440 --> 02:27.873
Your files should go to the Records Room.

8
02:27.873 --> 02:29.240
This is the Archives.

9
02:30.675 --> 02:32.880
I'm new here. Still getting familiar with the place.

10
02:32.880 --> 02:34.480
But I need to borrow some files.

11
02:34.480 --> 02:36.933
How do I make a request?

12
02:43.080 --> 02:44.353
Good.

13
02:45.200 --> 02:46.353
Come.

14
02:47.480 --> 02:48.686
Advisor Li.

15
02:49.640 --> 02:52.280
I need to look at some reference materials.

16
02:52.280 --> 02:54.680
Group Leader Bao said I have to get your signature.

17
02:54.680 --> 02:56.633
You could've left this in my office.

18
02:56.633 --> 02:58.853
You don't have to come to the range.

19
03:00.240 --> 03:02.880
I did go to your office, but you weren't there.

20
03:02.880 --> 03:05.424
And previous files were left unsigned.

21
03:05.424 --> 03:06.939
So I came to find you directly.

22
03:08.040 --> 03:11.480
That's it. Hold on, men.

23
03:11.480 --> 03:12.940
Steady.

24
03:14.640 --> 03:16.113
Advisor Li.

25
03:18.000 --> 03:19.213
Let me see.

26
03:24.440 --> 03:26.870
No rush.

27
03:26.870 --> 03:28.360
Yeah, hold on a little longer.

28
03:28.360 --> 03:32.306
Sweat more in training, bleed less in war.

29
03:46.160 --> 03:47.320
Secretary Jiang,

30
03:48.080 --> 03:52.800
since you finally made it out to the range, how about a little contest?

31
03:53.520 --> 03:56.000
Advisor Li, I'm not much of a shooter.

32
03:56.000 --> 03:57.630
I can't hold a candle to you.

33
03:57.630 --> 04:02.000
Secretary Jiang, I've seen your way with words.

34
04:02.000 --> 04:05.810
I'm sure your shooting's just as impressive.

35
04:05.810 --> 04:07.480
How about this?

36
04:07.480 --> 04:08.600
Let's have a match.

37
04:08.600 --> 04:11.532
You win, and I'll sign it right away.

38
04:11.532 --> 04:12.686
How's that?

39
04:22.240 --> 04:25.146
Then let's do it your way, Advisor Li.

40
04:44.999 --> 04:47.742
Advisor Li, 25 rings total.

41
04:47.742 --> 04:49.640
- Nice shooting. - Great.

42
04:49.640 --> 04:53.120
- As expected of Advisor Li. - Yeah, what a shot!

43
04:53.120 --> 04:56.846
Haven't practiced in so long. I'm a bit rusty.

44
04:57.566 --> 05:00.086
Secretary Jiang, your turn.

45
05:07.680 --> 05:08.846
Seven rings.

46
05:10.240 --> 05:12.280
You must be laughing at me, Advisor Li.

47
05:13.200 --> 05:15.856
It's fine. Don't be nervous.

48
05:15.856 --> 05:17.480
Just relax.

49
05:17.480 --> 05:20.684
Besides, I can tell you're not really at this level.

50
05:20.684 --> 05:24.466
Show them what you've got. Come on.

51
05:38.180 --> 05:40.466
- Nine rings. - Nine rings.

52
05:45.400 --> 05:46.513
Not bad.

53
05:46.513 --> 05:49.920
I told you luck would smile on you eventually, didn't I?

54
05:49.920 --> 05:51.866
Thanks for the encouragement, Advisor Li.

55
05:52.840 --> 05:54.613
One shot left.

56
06:08.746 --> 06:10.240
Ten rings.

57
06:10.240 --> 06:12.306
- Ten rings! - Ten rings!

58
06:13.660 --> 06:16.060
- No way. - Secretary Jiang's clearly a sharpshooter.

59
06:16.060 --> 06:18.039
No way he hit the bullseye otherwise.

60
06:20.200 --> 06:22.200
You were playing me just now, weren't you?

61
06:22.200 --> 06:24.600
It was just a game. Aren't games meant to be relaxing?

62
06:24.600 --> 06:26.397
Relaxing?

63
06:26.397 --> 06:31.000
You little brat, playing timid and dumb to make me look bad!

64
06:31.000 --> 06:34.400
You're toying with your superior officer!

65
06:34.400 --> 06:35.533
You!

66
06:38.000 --> 06:40.593
- Nice shooting. - Greetings, Corps Commander.

67
06:41.760 --> 06:44.145
- Corps Commander. - Secretary Jiang.

68
06:44.145 --> 06:45.760
You're skilled in both pen and gun.

69
06:45.760 --> 06:49.743
I remember your résumé said you studied grappling at a school in Japan, right?

70
06:49.743 --> 06:51.840
I want to spar with you.

71
06:51.840 --> 06:53.246
What do you say?

72
06:55.320 --> 06:56.693
You flatter me.

73
06:57.560 --> 06:59.280
Grappling's merely a hobby to me.

74
06:59.280 --> 07:00.793
Secretary Jiang.

75
07:01.640 --> 07:03.166
You're too modest.

76
07:04.720 --> 07:06.613
Don't tell me you look down on me.

77
07:19.560 --> 07:23.280
Don't go easy on me, Secretary Jiang.

78
07:23.280 --> 07:26.264
Against you, I'll have to go all out.

79
07:26.264 --> 07:28.240
Otherwise, I might not make it out alive.

80
07:28.880 --> 07:29.993
Good.

81
07:31.126 --> 07:33.245
That's the kind of fight I want in my men.

82
07:33.960 --> 07:36.877
But today, no fighting to the death.

83
07:36.877 --> 07:39.860
Whoever gets thrown out of the circle or taken down loses.

84
08:07.579 --> 08:11.180
- Nice! - Great! Corps Commander!

85
08:11.180 --> 08:12.259
Come on!

86
08:20.339 --> 08:22.800
- Great! - Great!

87
08:26.500 --> 08:29.160
- Well done, Corps Commander! - Impressive!

88
08:34.120 --> 08:35.366
Still not giving in?

89
08:35.366 --> 08:36.679
Just quit if you can't go on.

90
08:36.679 --> 08:38.420
But he has already been taken down, right?

91
09:46.080 --> 09:49.246
Secretary Jiang is both a scholar and a fighter.

92
09:49.905 --> 09:52.045
A rare all-rounder.

93
09:53.055 --> 09:54.680
You overpraised me, Corps Commander.

94
09:54.680 --> 09:57.000
I've already been thrown several times,

95
09:57.000 --> 09:58.672
and my foot went out of bounds.

96
09:58.672 --> 10:02.317
By the rules I learned in Japan, I've lost.

97
10:02.317 --> 10:05.779
We don't go by Japanese rules in a Chinese military camp.

98
10:06.800 --> 10:08.581
Call it a draw.

99
10:09.440 --> 10:13.040
Bo Ren, put him in for a commendation.

100
10:15.040 --> 10:16.560
Even this earns a commendation?

101
10:18.320 --> 10:19.960
Maybe I should take up wrestling.

102
10:31.480 --> 10:34.080
Auntie, this is Master Cai.

103
10:34.080 --> 10:36.360
I invited him to come from Suzhou.

104
10:36.360 --> 10:39.200
Having done embroidery for the imperial palace for three generations,

105
10:39.200 --> 10:40.977
his craftsmanship is second to none.

106
10:40.977 --> 10:44.058
You are always so thoughtful.

107
10:45.040 --> 10:48.240
Third Madam looks good in anything.

108
10:48.240 --> 10:49.543
Really?

109
10:49.543 --> 10:51.920
I feel like I've put on some weight since autumn started.

110
10:51.920 --> 10:54.686
- Quite self-conscious about it. - If you call that putting on weight,

111
10:54.686 --> 10:58.240
then my figure is a granary stocking up for winter.

112
10:59.455 --> 11:02.800
You're carefree and well-fed, looking prosperous.

113
11:02.800 --> 11:06.640
You've got a honeyed tongue to sweet-talk people.

114
11:07.340 --> 11:09.600
Zi Yi, you've probably heard too.

115
11:09.600 --> 11:11.840
Nanhuai recently took in a group of refugees.

116
11:11.840 --> 11:14.803
The Charity Union is planning to set up a new orphanage.

117
11:14.803 --> 11:18.980
My mother's been busy helping choose the site and coordinating with all the parties involved.

118
11:22.600 --> 11:24.800
Auntie, you're so kind and charitable.

119
11:24.800 --> 11:27.910
There's so much I want to learn from you.

120
11:29.000 --> 11:35.077
Mom, do you remember Ye Ping Jun, the one who petitioned for the refugees?

121
11:35.077 --> 11:39.360
She and Zi Yi were classmates at Mingde Girls' School.

122
11:40.740 --> 11:42.226
- Is that so? - Yes.

123
11:42.960 --> 11:49.139
However, the two of you have such different interests.

124
11:54.000 --> 11:56.520
Auntie, Qi Xuan is right.

125
11:56.520 --> 12:00.075
Everyone plays to their strengths and does their part.

126
12:00.075 --> 12:03.980
I'll ask my father to order a batch of supplies for the refugees.

127
12:03.980 --> 12:05.360
That would be great.

128
12:05.360 --> 12:06.879
That's very thoughtful of you, Zi Yi.

129
12:06.879 --> 12:08.273
Just doing my part.

130
12:09.373 --> 12:12.520
Auntie, do you like this fabric?

131
12:12.520 --> 12:13.720
It's lovely.

132
12:13.720 --> 12:14.840
What?

133
12:14.840 --> 12:16.666
You were out of line just then.

134
12:17.760 --> 12:20.840
She might marry Chang Xuan one day.

135
12:21.920 --> 12:23.480
Min Ru, you don't know her.

136
12:23.480 --> 12:25.637
Tao Zi Yi is so two-faced.

137
12:25.637 --> 12:28.840
At school, she leads a bunch of so-called rich girls around,

138
12:28.840 --> 12:30.560
throwing her weight around and bullying people,

139
12:30.560 --> 12:32.523
and she thinks nobody knows.

140
12:32.523 --> 12:34.160
I can't stand that act.

141
12:34.160 --> 12:36.044
I don't want her to be Chang Xuan's wife.

142
12:36.044 --> 12:37.913
Even so, you still can't talk like that.

143
12:39.960 --> 12:42.161
Okay. I'll drop it.

144
12:52.000 --> 12:53.161
Xue Ting.

145
12:54.960 --> 12:56.487
Xue Ting.

146
12:56.487 --> 12:57.699
Coming.

147
13:03.160 --> 13:05.586
- Here. - What did Auntie make this time?

148
13:06.440 --> 13:10.519
Mom made pan-fried tofu today, and here are Auntie Zhao's buns.

149
13:10.519 --> 13:12.240
All your favorites.

150
13:13.920 --> 13:15.500
Let me get you some water.

151
13:39.460 --> 13:40.580
Xue Ting.

152
13:42.539 --> 13:44.240
Are you injured?

153
13:49.840 --> 13:51.326
Just a little scrape.

154
13:52.160 --> 13:53.560
Let me see.

155
13:56.640 --> 13:58.320
How did you get hurt like this?

156
13:58.320 --> 13:59.766
What happened?

157
14:00.480 --> 14:02.257
A normal wrestling match at the camp.

158
14:02.257 --> 14:05.473
Why would they have a non-combatant member wrestle?

159
14:10.960 --> 14:15.353
It's fine. I agreed to spar with them myself.

160
14:16.720 --> 14:19.280
Come here, let me put some medicine on it.

161
14:23.700 --> 14:25.480
Here, give me your arm.

162
14:29.820 --> 14:31.620
Tell me if it hurts.

163
14:47.920 --> 14:49.246
Does it still hurt?

164
14:50.360 --> 14:51.805
Not anymore.

165
14:51.805 --> 14:55.185
With you taking care of me, any wound heals.

166
15:03.680 --> 15:06.280
Your shoulder is injured too.

167
15:06.280 --> 15:07.993
Let me take a look.

168
15:10.500 --> 15:11.873
Careful.

169
15:14.960 --> 15:16.360
Tell me if it hurts.

170
15:36.360 --> 15:39.893
Master Chang Xuan, wait up.

171
15:46.600 --> 15:48.260
May I have a word with you?

172
15:52.320 --> 15:56.080
Miss Ye came all this way here. What's so urgent?

173
15:56.080 --> 15:58.380
Did you intentionally hurt Jiang Xue Ting?

174
15:59.160 --> 16:02.039
You mean Secretary Jiang? Do you know each other?

175
16:02.039 --> 16:04.000
Don't play dumb.

176
16:04.000 --> 16:06.606
You already know what we are to each other, don't you?

177
16:07.960 --> 16:11.179
Then why don't you tell me what you two are?

178
16:14.480 --> 16:18.920
Is he... your sweetheart or something?

179
16:21.480 --> 16:23.373
That's none of your business.

180
16:24.000 --> 16:28.493
I wonder why a non-combatant officer had to take part in a wrestling match.

181
16:29.800 --> 16:32.200
Non-combatant or combatant members,

182
16:32.200 --> 16:36.200
it's perfectly normal for anyone in my 9th Corps

183
16:36.200 --> 16:39.141
to get hurt during grappling drills in routine training.

184
16:40.120 --> 16:43.480
If you're holding a grudge because I slapped you at the refugee camp,

185
16:43.480 --> 16:45.120
I remember I apologized.

186
16:45.720 --> 16:49.206
But if you still can't get over it, then slap me back.

187
16:56.240 --> 16:57.693
Are you serious?

188
17:02.960 --> 17:04.233
No regrets?

189
17:07.040 --> 17:08.339
No regrets.

190
17:11.660 --> 17:12.893
Fine.

191
17:14.560 --> 17:16.280
I hit quite hard.

192
17:21.280 --> 17:22.533
Brace yourself.

193
17:30.280 --> 17:31.613
Go ahead.

194
18:47.600 --> 18:49.120
Why didn't you?

195
18:50.480 --> 18:52.479
I'm still too soft-hearted toward a beauty.

196
18:53.866 --> 18:58.020
A face like that, who could bring themselves to slap it?

197
19:02.079 --> 19:03.400
Secretary Jiang.

198
19:04.680 --> 19:05.980
Secretary Jiang.

199
19:08.400 --> 19:09.686
Xue Ting.

200
19:12.320 --> 19:13.760
Ping Jun.

201
19:14.880 --> 19:16.026
Corps Commander.

202
19:18.680 --> 19:19.873
What are you doing here?

203
19:22.880 --> 19:28.253
Secretary Jiang, I only found out today that Miss Ye is your girlfriend.

204
19:32.040 --> 19:34.453
Didn't she tell you she knows me?

205
19:38.073 --> 19:40.380
She did.

206
19:40.380 --> 19:42.950
She said you two had a run-in at Xiangxi Hotel before,

207
19:42.950 --> 19:44.184
but it's been cleared up.

208
19:44.184 --> 19:46.026
Water under the bridge.

209
19:46.026 --> 19:47.626
That's what she told you?

210
19:53.240 --> 19:56.313
But that doesn't seem that easy to clear up.

211
19:56.313 --> 19:59.676
She saw you were hurt and decided I bullied you.

212
19:59.676 --> 20:01.720
She came all the way here to confront me,

213
20:02.360 --> 20:04.726
saying I abused my power.

214
20:07.000 --> 20:08.317
That's on me.

215
20:08.317 --> 20:10.624
I didn't explain things clearly to Ping Jun.

216
20:10.624 --> 20:12.360
I bear some responsibility too.

217
20:12.360 --> 20:14.400
I was indeed heavy-handed.

218
20:14.400 --> 20:16.917
Well, I'm off duty today.

219
20:16.917 --> 20:20.240
To make it up to you, I'll drive you both home.

220
20:20.240 --> 20:21.453
No need.

221
20:26.720 --> 20:28.859
We couldn't trouble you like that, Master Chang Xuan.

222
20:28.859 --> 20:31.520
Right, we can get home on our own.

223
20:31.520 --> 20:35.873
What, you won't even give me a chance to apologize?

224
21:01.640 --> 21:04.833
Secretary Jiang and Miss Ye are a perfect match.

225
21:04.833 --> 21:06.790
Have you been neighbors since childhood?

226
21:06.790 --> 21:10.133
Our mothers were sworn sisters.

227
21:10.133 --> 21:12.433
Ping Jun and I grew up together.

228
21:13.480 --> 21:15.459
So you were promised to each other as kids?

229
21:16.240 --> 21:17.333
Yes.

230
21:18.119 --> 21:20.365
Miss Ye is so talented and beautiful.

231
21:20.365 --> 21:23.526
How could you bear to leave her for four years?

232
21:24.465 --> 21:28.206
Weren't you afraid someone would steal away such a wonderful girlfriend?

233
21:29.472 --> 21:31.280
My mother taught me since I was little

234
21:31.280 --> 21:33.360
that once I've set my heart on someone or something,

235
21:33.360 --> 21:36.546
I shouldn't let other people or things distract me.

236
21:37.360 --> 21:40.780
Single-minded devotion? That's rare.

237
21:45.960 --> 21:47.760
Please turn right at the next intersection.

238
21:47.760 --> 21:49.206
I know the way.

239
21:58.720 --> 22:02.086
When Miss Ye was sick before, I delivered medicine to her for Lan Qing.

240
22:03.000 --> 22:05.144
Xue Ting, did you know?

241
22:05.144 --> 22:07.079
Master Chang Xuan is an opera expert.

242
22:07.079 --> 22:08.960
He's a longtime fan of Miss Lan Qing.

243
22:08.960 --> 22:10.480
You flatter me.

244
22:10.480 --> 22:14.630
Miss Ye at Yuchun Opera House is also famous for her talent.

245
22:14.630 --> 22:17.819
When she resigned, everyone was very reluctant to see her go.

246
22:20.080 --> 22:24.260
It's embarrassing to say, if I'd come home sooner,

247
22:25.480 --> 22:30.460
Ping Jun wouldn't have had to work while studying.

248
22:37.000 --> 22:40.699
You two are so close. It's truly enviable.

249
22:50.000 --> 22:53.060
Corps Commander, it's still early.

250
22:53.060 --> 22:56.033
If you don't mind, why don't you join us for tea?

251
22:57.640 --> 22:59.004
Maybe next time.

252
22:59.004 --> 23:01.040
I have to get home and feed my birds.

253
23:01.040 --> 23:04.280
My canaries are hard to please.

254
23:04.953 --> 23:05.986
All right.

255
23:06.840 --> 23:08.040
Ping Jun,

256
23:09.000 --> 23:10.579
let's go.

257
23:10.579 --> 23:11.700
Okay.

258
23:46.040 --> 23:48.720
Won't eat this, won't take that.

259
23:48.720 --> 23:50.621
I've spoiled you rotten,

260
23:55.120 --> 23:57.326
giving you such a bad temper.

261
24:07.412 --> 24:09.613
You don't like the cage I gave you...

262
24:14.840 --> 24:16.980
but where else are you going to fly?

263
24:23.520 --> 24:25.640
How's the translation group coming along?

264
24:25.640 --> 24:27.080
Extremely efficient.

265
24:27.080 --> 24:29.480
They finished the first batch of weapons documents in a week.

266
24:29.480 --> 24:31.600
Jiang Xue Ting is indeed talented.

267
24:31.600 --> 24:33.784
He handled the core translation himself.

268
24:33.784 --> 24:37.141
At this rate, all three batches will be done by the end of the month.

269
24:37.141 --> 24:38.299
[Corps Commander's Office]

270
24:38.299 --> 24:41.446
Once the materials are ready, we can call the old generals in for a meeting.

271
24:46.160 --> 24:47.401
Surprise!

272
24:48.280 --> 24:49.920
What are you doing here?

273
24:49.920 --> 24:53.652
What, not happy to see me?

274
24:53.652 --> 24:54.840
No, not at all.

275
24:56.667 --> 24:58.373
Why didn't you call ahead?

276
24:59.880 --> 25:01.240
If I didn't come,

277
25:01.240 --> 25:05.359
I was afraid my boyfriend would grow wings and fly off.

278
25:05.359 --> 25:06.666
How could that be?

279
25:07.300 --> 25:10.106
Why'd you come straight here instead of looking for me at home?

280
25:10.760 --> 25:14.080
I would've, but every time I go to your home,

281
25:14.080 --> 25:16.920
you're usually not there.

282
25:16.920 --> 25:18.400
That's on me.

283
25:18.400 --> 25:20.593
I haven't been around much lately.

284
25:23.080 --> 25:24.837
I understand.

285
25:24.837 --> 25:26.840
You just took over the 9th Corps,

286
25:26.840 --> 25:29.480
and you have to help your father with piled-up military business.

287
25:29.480 --> 25:31.280
You're out early, back late every day.

288
25:31.280 --> 25:35.600
I made you duck soup with lingzhi and jujube to help you unwind.

289
25:44.200 --> 25:47.141
I simmered it for a full eight hours.

290
25:49.680 --> 25:51.200
Why cook it yourself?

291
25:51.200 --> 25:52.793
We have so many cooks at home.

292
25:52.793 --> 25:54.457
It's not the same.

293
25:54.457 --> 26:00.500
What they make doesn't have my care in it.

294
26:09.320 --> 26:10.639
Careful, it's hot.

295
26:20.920 --> 26:23.279
I didn't expect it, Miss Zi Yi.

296
26:23.279 --> 26:27.420
Besides being a wonderful dancer, you're also a first-rate cook.

297
26:28.960 --> 26:33.593
That's why you're very lucky.

298
26:35.900 --> 26:37.460
Certainly I am.

299
26:39.640 --> 26:44.400
Military business is important, but you need to take care of yourself too.

300
26:44.400 --> 26:45.579
I know.

301
26:46.640 --> 26:50.826
My father wants to invite you to dinner at our place recently.

302
26:52.480 --> 26:53.606
Sounds good.

303
26:55.720 --> 26:56.966
Corps Commander.

304
27:03.120 --> 27:04.439
It's you.

305
27:05.000 --> 27:06.506
What are you doing here?

306
27:07.800 --> 27:09.740
What, you know him?

307
27:09.740 --> 27:11.019
He...

308
27:12.960 --> 27:16.146
He's my newly hired translation secretary, Jiang Xue Ting.

309
27:18.920 --> 27:22.006
Translation secretary?

310
27:23.320 --> 27:26.093
This is my girlfriend, Tao Zi Yi.

311
27:27.680 --> 27:31.341
Miss Tao. Sorry for offending you at the school gate before.

312
27:33.280 --> 27:35.320
So you two have history?

313
27:37.600 --> 27:39.805
Secretary Jiang enjoys lecturing others.

314
27:39.805 --> 27:43.240
That's a kind of history I can do without.

315
27:45.600 --> 27:46.833
Corps Commander,

316
27:49.120 --> 27:52.080
if there's nothing else, I'm going to my office.

317
28:02.640 --> 28:04.080
Master Chang Xuan,

318
28:08.640 --> 28:13.960
did you really not know that Jiang Xue Ting is Ye Ping Jun's boyfriend?

319
28:13.960 --> 28:15.864
I really didn't know it before.

320
28:15.864 --> 28:17.703
Li Bo Ren told me later.

321
28:19.000 --> 28:20.720
What a coincidence.

322
28:20.720 --> 28:24.810
When he came to pick up Ye Ping Jun at school,

323
28:24.810 --> 28:28.160
we had a bit of a run-in.

324
28:29.320 --> 28:30.886
I see.

325
28:31.760 --> 28:34.703
And was hiring him really a coincidence?

326
28:34.703 --> 28:36.243
Not a coincidence.

327
28:37.240 --> 28:38.886
He was carefully selected.

328
28:39.600 --> 28:42.073
Once you see his résumé, you'll understand.

329
28:42.073 --> 28:44.700
He's a rare talent.

330
28:46.720 --> 28:48.006
Really?

331
28:49.200 --> 28:50.781
Don't you trust my judgment?

332
28:58.360 --> 29:00.640
Xue Ting, not leaving yet?

333
29:00.640 --> 29:03.640
Group Leader, I still have two pages to work on.

334
29:03.640 --> 29:05.317
How about you give me the files?

335
29:05.317 --> 29:07.280
I'll archive them later.

336
29:07.280 --> 29:08.790
All right. Here.

337
29:08.790 --> 29:11.680
Thank you. See you tomorrow.

338
29:11.680 --> 29:12.799
See you.

339
29:58.200 --> 30:00.400
[Archives]

340
30:08.640 --> 30:09.793
Excuse me.

341
30:14.440 --> 30:16.000
I'm not familiar with this place yet.

342
30:16.000 --> 30:18.833
Could you check if these files are in the right spot?

343
30:18.833 --> 30:20.840
Sure, leave it to me. You go on ahead.

344
30:20.840 --> 30:22.153
Thanks.

345
30:47.320 --> 30:50.080
Wu, turn the car around. Back to Headquarters. I left a file there.

346
30:50.080 --> 30:51.586
Yes, sir.

347
32:45.760 --> 32:47.080
Secretary Jiang.

348
32:48.000 --> 32:51.000
What are you doing here this late?

349
32:51.000 --> 32:52.560
Reporting to the Corps Commander,

350
32:52.560 --> 32:56.125
I've been busy translating documents on the German-made M18 submachine gun.

351
32:56.125 --> 32:59.820
So I requested access to the materials from Group Leader Bao and Advisor Li.

352
33:19.760 --> 33:25.800
Secretary Jiang, do you think the reference materials collected here are accurate?

353
33:27.400 --> 33:28.937
They're enough for now,

354
33:28.937 --> 33:34.618
but I'd suggest updating them more often to keep them current.

355
33:45.560 --> 33:46.780
You have a point.

356
33:50.960 --> 33:54.260
If there's nothing else, I'm going back to my office.

357
34:37.280 --> 34:40.280
[Nanhuai Orphanage]

358
34:44.120 --> 34:45.120
Give me a hand.

359
34:45.840 --> 34:47.400
Madam Yu, Master Chang Xuan,

360
34:47.400 --> 34:50.653
thank you for coming to visit the orphans in person.

361
34:50.653 --> 34:53.320
Hadn't you negotiated with the cotton mill,

362
34:53.320 --> 34:56.240
they would've never agreed to lend us these dormitories.

363
34:56.240 --> 35:02.384
I came today to talk with you about what the orphanage shall do next.

364
35:02.384 --> 35:06.380
I also brought some medical consumables for the kids.

365
35:06.380 --> 35:08.079
Thank you so much.

366
35:09.840 --> 35:11.780
Let me introduce you.

367
35:13.800 --> 35:17.004
This is Liang Wen Bo, director of the Spring Wind Troupe.

368
35:17.004 --> 35:18.380
Nice to meet you, Madam Yu.

369
35:18.380 --> 35:21.000
Nice to meet you, Director Liang. You're young and accomplished.

370
35:21.000 --> 35:22.600
You flatter me.

371
35:22.600 --> 35:25.360
This is Ye Ping Jun, the troupe's scriptwriter.

372
35:25.360 --> 35:26.784
Nice to meet you.

373
35:26.784 --> 35:28.760
After the orphanage site was decided,

374
35:28.760 --> 35:32.366
they came to help us move and clean, running around.

375
35:33.160 --> 35:34.760
You're Ye Ping Jun?

376
35:34.760 --> 35:38.120
I've read about you in the papers. Finally get to meet you in person.

377
35:38.120 --> 35:39.800
Hello, I'm Yu Qi Xuan.

378
35:39.800 --> 35:42.000
I'm your fan from now on.

379
35:42.000 --> 35:44.200
Thank you, Miss Qi Xuan.

380
35:44.200 --> 35:49.450
I appreciate you, young people for fighting for the Charity Union's vote.

381
35:49.450 --> 35:53.397
You turned the vote around all by yourselves.

382
35:53.397 --> 35:55.579
Madam Yu, it's what we should do.

383
35:56.640 --> 36:00.800
Miss Ye is known for her talent and compassion.

384
36:00.800 --> 36:06.353
What's even rarer is that her sharp tongue is as brilliant as her scripts.

385
36:06.353 --> 36:08.873
I've had the honor of facing it.

386
36:13.080 --> 36:16.713
Ping Jun, we've registered the bedding sent by the Charity Union.

387
36:16.713 --> 36:18.373
Lan Qing, over here.

388
36:31.640 --> 36:33.106
Madam Yu,

389
36:34.200 --> 36:35.640
Lady Min Ru.

390
36:37.120 --> 36:38.921
Haven't seen you in a while.

391
36:39.600 --> 36:41.301
How have you been?

392
36:41.959 --> 36:44.493
Very well, thanks to you.

393
36:46.720 --> 36:49.720
Madam Yu, the reception room is ready. This way, please.

394
36:49.720 --> 36:51.126
Alright.

395
36:57.480 --> 37:00.880
The shower room is fixed and opens once a day.

396
37:00.880 --> 37:03.240
The Chamber of Commerce donated the heating equipment,

397
37:03.240 --> 37:05.840
and the infirmary has a doctor on duty regularly.

398
37:05.840 --> 37:06.960
Right.

399
37:06.960 --> 37:09.880
Kids are young and frail.

400
37:09.880 --> 37:12.986
They need a full-time doctor.

401
37:14.160 --> 37:15.853
As for that...

402
37:16.720 --> 37:19.320
I'll ask the Health Bureau to sort it out.

403
37:20.400 --> 37:22.720
Then thank you so much, Madam Yu.

404
37:22.720 --> 37:27.538
If the kids need anything, feel free to call Yu's Mansion.

405
37:27.538 --> 37:28.953
Thank you.

406
37:34.040 --> 37:36.920
Lady Min Ru, please go ahead.

407
37:38.480 --> 37:41.866
I heard you're still performing at Yuchun Opera House,

408
37:42.512 --> 37:45.120
and Chang Xuan often goes to support you?

409
37:45.120 --> 37:48.033
Yes, but why ask?

410
37:49.340 --> 37:52.240
I know you lost your child back then,

411
37:52.240 --> 37:54.593
and that it was your only child.

412
37:56.200 --> 38:00.666
I understand you hold a grudge against the Yu family.

413
38:04.440 --> 38:05.940
That's why I wanted to tell you...

414
38:05.940 --> 38:07.380
What are you trying to say?

415
38:13.240 --> 38:17.333
I mean, you and Ming Xuan were together back then,

416
38:18.360 --> 38:20.600
and your relationship came to a tragic end.

417
38:20.600 --> 38:23.960
Now Chang Xuan is the only male heir in the Yu family

418
38:23.960 --> 38:26.197
and the successor my father-in-law values most.

419
38:26.197 --> 38:28.520
You're still so close to him.

420
38:28.520 --> 38:30.259
You shouldn't be!

421
38:31.559 --> 38:34.000
You're telling the wrong person.

422
38:34.000 --> 38:36.279
Master Chang Xuan loves opera and loves supporting performers.

423
38:36.840 --> 38:40.880
If you want to keep him in line, then tell him yourself.

424
38:57.760 --> 39:01.644
Miss, remember to check these common medicines we prepared for you regularly.

425
39:01.644 --> 39:03.320
Make sure it has not expired before taking it.

426
39:03.320 --> 39:05.080
[Iodine Tincture] [Sterile Bandage] We'll keep that in mind.

427
39:05.080 --> 39:06.739
Good, get back to work.

428
39:06.739 --> 39:11.167
You'd make a wonderful pediatrician if you worked in a hospital.

429
39:11.167 --> 39:12.240
- Let me. - Put it here.

430
39:12.240 --> 39:15.360
When you have kids, I'll help you look after them.

431
39:16.380 --> 39:19.520
Help! Where's the medicine kit?

432
39:19.520 --> 39:20.784
What happened? Who's hurt?

433
39:20.784 --> 39:24.846
A badly placed box in the courtyard fell and hit a girl from the Spring Wind Troupe.

434
39:57.739 --> 39:59.079
Does it hurt?

435
39:59.079 --> 40:00.179
A little.

436
40:46.440 --> 40:47.940
Done. I'll put it away.

437
40:47.940 --> 40:49.000
Thank you.

438
40:53.800 --> 40:55.273
Master Chang Xuan.

439
41:04.600 --> 41:06.221
What's up?

440
41:07.400 --> 41:08.746
Nothing.

441
41:09.445 --> 41:14.065
My mother sent me to ask if the children need any clothes, food, or other daily supplies.

442
41:14.680 --> 41:16.579
She'll have them prepared and sent over.

443
41:17.560 --> 41:20.320
No need. Madam Yu has already prepared more than enough.

444
41:20.320 --> 41:21.946
Please thank her for me.

445
41:26.836 --> 41:28.877
All right. Go get some rest.

446
41:28.877 --> 41:30.386
I'll be going, then.

447
41:54.280 --> 41:57.840
Jin Xuan, why are you still up this late?

448
41:57.840 --> 42:01.019
And you're still up this late working hard too, Chang Xuan.

449
42:09.440 --> 42:11.746
Snow pear, white fungus, and lily bulb soup.

450
42:11.746 --> 42:13.846
You used to make this for me when I was little.

451
42:21.079 --> 42:22.559
Why are you looking at me like that?

452
42:23.640 --> 42:27.420
Today, you were off at the orphanage.

453
42:28.280 --> 42:29.519
What do you mean?

454
42:29.519 --> 42:31.300
I could tell.

455
42:31.300 --> 42:33.340
You care about Miss Ye.

456
42:38.960 --> 42:40.840
Jin Xuan, you must be joking.

457
42:42.200 --> 42:46.373
Chang Xuan, your eyes don't lie.

458
42:49.480 --> 42:51.386
I'm Zi Yi's boyfriend now.

459
42:58.600 --> 43:00.960
I've already married for this family's sake.

460
43:01.600 --> 43:03.620
Only me is enough.

461
43:04.880 --> 43:10.400
I want you and Qi Xuan to grow old with someone you truly love.

462
43:16.640 --> 43:18.781
My biggest regret in this life is

463
43:20.040 --> 43:24.580
that I never fought against my fate.

464
43:28.380 --> 43:30.699
I lost the person I cherished most.

465
43:34.820 --> 43:36.559
After all these years,

466
43:37.680 --> 43:40.140
Bing Wen still hasn't won your heart.

467
43:42.600 --> 43:45.320
Sooner or later, you'll understand.

468
43:45.320 --> 43:50.760
Feelings have nothing to do with time.

469
43:56.840 --> 43:59.939
It's late. Get some rest.

470
44:10.440 --> 44:11.760
Chang Xuan,

471
44:14.240 --> 44:16.040
be honest with yourself.

472
44:16.860 --> 44:22.639
Some people, once you let them slip away are gone for good.
